  "description": "Eom Ji-Cheok was just an underappreciated hunter's assistant until an odd dream and a simple thumbs up triggered his awakening as a hunter and hot GodTube influencer. Ji-Cheok doesn't earn points by killing monsters though. Instead, he must do good deeds and gain the approval of others. So when a heroic video of him goes viral and top companies start wooing him with contracts, it seems like the sky's the limit. But will fame be a more dangerous game than our rising star expected...? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
